From d22bc547681de1b77abdebf7556ac54655461a25 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alaric McKenzie-Boone <alaric.mckenzie.boone@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 06:02:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add lane-12 per-captain squad split and follow policy
 (#130)

Engine-free slice toward two-captain play: P2SquadFollowPolicy (the
inactive captain's follow bands, thresholds and speed curve from
NaviFollowState::exec), whistle/dismiss priority decisions, and
P2CaptainPolicy::splitSquad/transferSquad with deterministic actor
ordering. P2CaptainAdapter::splitSquad mirrors Piki::mNavi through the
live host callbacks. Adds tools/test_p2_squad_policy.cpp and extends the
adapter engine-double test. No engine behavior changes; second-captain
live gate stays closed.
---
